{"parse": {"title": "苦盐簇", "pageid": 2258, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"苦盐簇\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/aa/Item-110201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"苦盐簇\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>苦盐簇</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#110201</div></div><hr /><div>未提纯的盐柱。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">在高阶祝祷中难抵大用。贩卖者保证那些看起来像是人形回首的部分，只是自然的巧合。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">仓库·<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/481005\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%9D%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%A3%E5%AD%90\" title=\"初阶秘物匣子\"><img alt=\"Bgequip2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/100px-Bgequip2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/150px-Bgequip2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/200px-Bgequip2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%9D%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%A3%E5%AD%90\" title=\